@startuml
title Editor Input To Paint Flow

skinparam shadowing false

actor User
participant "Flutter Canvas" as UI
participant "Event Queue" as Queue
participant "Rust EditorBuffer" as Core
participant "Patch Stream" as Stream
participant "Viewport Painter" as Painter

User -> UI : key press / pointer action
UI -> Queue : normalize editor command
Queue -> Core : Insert/Delete transaction
Core -> Core : apply rope mutation\npush undo entry\nincrement revision
Core -> Stream : emit Vec<Patch>
Stream -> UI : patch batch + revision
UI -> Painter : update visible model
Painter -> User : next frame

note over Core
Never ship full text
for the steady-state path.
end note

@enduml
